  "bodyHash": "7c5cd3bc38d0af85",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>東方小女僕</h1>\n<p>這是一個適用於 Minecraft 1.16.5-1.20.1 的 Forge 模組，其靈感來自 <a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a> 模組與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">東方 Project</a>。<br>\n為 Minecraft 加入了可愛的女僕，她們能協助戰鬥、農業及其他任務。<br>\n本模組支援以基岩版實體（Entity）格式製作的自訂模型，您可以輕鬆切換女僕模型，或自行創作專屬的女僕模型。</p>\n<h2>圖片</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4ddb34836457d9b4daf1f72bd0f7cdad0da0953d.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eea50440aeeb0bea18858ee6afbf362a8f0f53e7.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8523790ba7c7abf66ba5cc315f6699277bf97761.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7493a33b9330b78b1ba228a1808d6d11a878635f.jpeg\" alt=\"女僕\"></p>\n<h3>影片</h3>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\">已移除嵌入： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f1RlsOLinuis\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1RlsOLinuis</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\">已移除嵌入： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fxKowWaJCIYA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xKowWaJCIYA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\">已移除嵌入： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f8Eo2GM-a7iA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8Eo2GM-a7iA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2>注意事項</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若您有任何意見或建議，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">討論區</a> 提供反饋。    </li>\n<li>若發現任何錯誤，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報</a> 提交工單。</li>\n<li>您可以前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">版本發布</a> 下載快照版本模組，但請注意：<strong>快照版本模組可能會非常不穩定</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>開發人員</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>程式開發：<code>TartaricAcid</code>、<code>Snownee</code></li>\n<li>美術設計：<code>Succinum</code>、<code>Pajinyi</code>、<code>ZeniCrow</code>、<code>Tian_mi</code>、<code>Paulzzh</code>、<code>YurisCat</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致謝名單</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MMM 與 Verclene：開發了 <a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a> 模組</li>\n<li>ZUN：創立了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">東方 Project</a></li>\n<li>音效資源來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww14.big.or.jp%252f%257eamiami%252fhappy%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">あみたろの声素材工房</a></li>\n<li>LittleMaid PEKO 音效：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://booth.pm/ja/items/1903163&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>五子棋 AI：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/anlingyi/xechat-idea&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>以及其他所有曾以任何方式幫助過我的玩家，還有您</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>女僕 AI 聊天支援多種 AI 框架：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplayer2.game%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player2</a></li>\n<li>OpenAI</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>程式碼：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mit.edu%252f%257eamini%252fLICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a></li>\n<li>資產檔案：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></li>\n</ul>",
